  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Democratic policing Monte</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Demokratisk polis Monte</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall project objective is to make the Montenegrin Police Service in line with international standards of modern and democratic policing, with overall reform of the Montenegrin society and with the ongoing reform efforts of CG MUP in particular.The three key areas of the project are 1)police education, 2)crime investigation and 3)the capacity of CG MUP to plan and follow up on police activities.</narrative>
  </description>
